                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This time I bought spicy chicken, squid rings, and tofu skin. I highly recommend the squid rings (they\u0027re incredibly delicious!), super fresh and with a bouncy texture, like they were just caught from the sea! The spicy chicken is also amazing! It\u0027s different from regular fried chicken; this is my favorite fried food lately!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "這次購買潑辣雞、魷魚圈、百頁，真心推薦魷魚圈（無敵爆炸好吃），超新鮮且肉質Q彈，像剛從海裏現撈的一樣！潑辣雞也超好吃！跟一般鹹酥雞不一樣，近期最愛的炸物就是這家了！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
