                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I saw it on Gomaji, so I decided to try it. The wait was 30 minutes, which is quite long. You can wait inside, otherwise it\u0027s very windy outside.\n\nI chose the cumin flavor, and it was super delicious!\n\nI think the tempura was the best.\n\nThe vegetables were okay.\n\nThe tofu skin was also super crispy and great! There were a lot of fried chicken pieces!\n\nHowever, I didn\u0027t really like the simplified Chinese characters on the packaging.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "看到gomaji上有\n來試試看\n要等30分鐘蠻久的\n店裡面可以等一下 不然外面風很大\n我選孜然口味 超好吃\n我覺得甜不辣最讚\n蔬菜偏還好\n啊豆皮也超酥很讚\n鹹酥雞很多隻！\n不過包裝蠻多簡體字是稍微不是那麼喜歡的",
